    "analysis": {
      "investment_rationale": [
        {
          "institution": "General Catalyst",
          "speaker": "Yuri Sagalov",
          "speaker_role": "Managing Director",
          "rationale": "General Catalyst投资Melius是因为创始团队在快速转型和执行方面展现出信念与速度，且Melius构建了真正的操作系统，让代理能够将工作流从初稿推进到成品资产，随着AI代理能力增强，全工作流优势将不断累积。",
          "quote": "Watching Joowon, Young, and Arnav pivot and execute at speed showed exactly the kind of conviction and execution we look for in founders. While most generative AI tools for creative teams are single-purpose — a prompt box here, an editor there — Melius has now built a true operating system where agents can take a workflow from first draft to finished asset. As AI agents get more capable, that full-workflow is where the advantage will compound",
          "evidence_refs": [
            {
              "source_id": "FISRC-17b0a4ba7027e6a1",
              "quote": "\"Watching Joowon, Young, and Arnav pivot and execute at speed showed exactly the kind of conviction and execution we look for in founders. While most generative AI tools for creative teams are single-purpose — a prompt box here, an editor there — Melius has now built a true operating system where agents can take a workflow from first draft to finished asset. As AI agents get more capable, that full-workflow is where the advantage will compound,\" said Yuri Sagalov, Managing Director at General Catalyst.",
              "source_content_hash": "211f9e27654b79b5",
              "quote_hash": "4a4ef9d3b2e12732174ec8a7d348bbc32f4d291cc3cb82eb5104210623071454"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "capital_judgment": "资本押注的核心变量是Melius能否将“创意工作代理实验室”从单一工具升级为创意团队的全工作流操作系统，并在竞争激烈的AI创意生成市场中建立差异化。当前融资所依赖的已验证信号包括：公司从隐身模式推出后两个月内年化收入超过100万美元，数千个创意团队每日使用其平台，以及创始团队来自Ramp的工程背景和快速转型执行力。判断的证据边界在于：收入数据为公司自述，尚未经独立审计；竞争对手Higgsfield年化收入超过7亿美元且估值54亿美元，Melius规模仍小；公司未披露本轮估值，资本回报预期缺乏定价参照。",
      "validated_signals": [
        "公司从隐身模式推出后两个月内年化收入超过100万美元",
        "数千个创意团队每日在Melius上构建品牌创意资产",
        "创始团队来自Ramp，具有工程背景",
        "公司已从首款产品转型为创意工作代理实验室"
      ],
